{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1321709001:0":{"text":"よほっ！ちょうどお前さんたちに会いたかったんだ！","source_cn":"嚯！我正想着你们呢，你们就来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FC5121E9F1E9589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321709002:0":{"text":"何か良さそうなアイデアはないか？祭典の氷像を作り終えてから面白い仕事がなくてな。退屈で仕方がないんだ！","source_cn":"快来帮我想想，之后该造点啥？祭典的冰雕造完之后，镇里都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x614D347952CB96D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321709003:0":{"text":"えっと……氷の棺なんてどうでしょう？","source_cn":"这个……从冰雕换成冰棺怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3938C624F09E9551","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321709004:0":{"text":"氷は氷像で嫌と言うほど触ったからなぁ……","source_cn":"……那不还是和冰打交道吗？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x45063AE71CE9844D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"氷は氷像で嫌と言うほど触ったからなぁ……","female":"氷は氷像で嫌と言うほど触ったからなぁ……","variant_male_record_index":"153247","variant_female_record_index":"153248","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1321709004":{"text":"氷は氷像で嫌と言うほど触ったからなぁ……","source_cn":"……那不还是和冰打交道吗？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x45063AE71CE9844D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"氷は氷像で嫌と言うほど触ったからなぁ……","female":"氷は氷像で嫌と